<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
<title>Your healdesk plan ends on 6 November</title>
<style>@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  body, .hd-wrap { background: #0d1117 !important; color: #e6edf3 !important; }
  .hd-muted { color: #9da7b3 !important; }
  a { color: #8cc4ff !important; }
  a.hd-action { background: #e6edf3 !important; color: #0d1117 !important; }
}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#1f2328;">
<span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">Turn auto-renew back on before then to keep it.</span>
<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Auto-renew is off, so your healdesk plan ends on Friday 6 November. AYA keeps answering until then.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Because you turned it off within 14 days of your plan starting, your first period&#39;s fee is due back to you in full. We&#39;ll email you by Wednesday 7 October to arrange the refund.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Changed your mind? Turn auto-renew back on in Billing before then, and nothing changes.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 24px;"><a class="hd-action" href="https://app.healdesk.test/" style="display:inline-block;background:#1f2328;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Turn auto-renew back on</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">When the plan ends, we&#39;ll email you how to undo call forwarding and what happens to your data.</p>
<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #d0d7de;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">You&#39;re receiving this because this is the address on Radiance Med Spa&#39;s healdesk account.</p>
