<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">US mailing address (correspondence only): 800 N King Street, Suite 304-1426, Wilmington, DE 19801, United States</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>",
  "preheader": "Turn auto-renew back on before then to keep it.",
  "subject": "Your healdesk plan ends on 6 November",
  "text": "Auto-renew is off, so your healdesk plan ends on Friday 6 November. AYA keeps answering until then.

Because you turned it off within 14 days of your plan starting, your first period's fee is due back to you in full. We'll email you by Wednesday 7 October to arrange the refund.

Changed your mind? Turn auto-renew back on in Billing before then, and nothing changes.

Turn auto-renew back on: https://app.healdesk.test/

When the plan ends, we'll email you how to undo call forwarding and what happens to your data.

