  body, .hd-wrap { background: #0d1117 !important; color: #e6edf3 !important; }
  .hd-muted { color: #9da7b3 !important; }
  a { color: #8cc4ff !important; }
  a.hd-action { background: #e6edf3 !important; color: #0d1117 !important; }
}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#1f2328;">
<span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">Calls still pass through to your direct line until 6 December.</span>
<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your healdesk service ended on Friday 6 November, and AYA has stopped answering.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">For 30 days, until Sunday 6 December, calls that still forward to us pass straight through to your direct line. Undo the forwarding before then, so callers keep reaching you directly. From the clinic&#39;s own line, dial these AT&amp;T codes:</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;"><li>Cancel all-call forwarding: *73</li></ul>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your website chat shows a contact form until you remove the healdesk snippet from your website.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">We&#39;ll email you when your export of transcripts and the booking log is ready. Download it by Sunday 6 December.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">We destroy our copies of your data within 30 days of your export being delivered, and by Thursday 4 February 2027 at the latest. Billing records are kept, as tax law requires.</p>
<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #d0d7de;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">You&#39;re receiving this because this is the address on Radiance Med Spa&#39;s healdesk account.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">Replies reach the healdesk team. Please leave out patient details.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">healdesk is a service of Viixi FZC, a company registered under the Sharjah Publishing City Free Zone, United Arab Emirates.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">US mailing address (correspondence only): 800 N King Street, Suite 304-1426, Wilmington, DE 19801, United States</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>",
  "preheader": "Calls still pass through to your direct line until 6 December.",
  "subject": "Your healdesk service has ended",
  "text": "Your healdesk service ended on Friday 6 November, and AYA has stopped answering.

For 30 days, until Sunday 6 December, calls that still forward to us pass straight through to your direct line. Undo the forwarding before then, so callers keep reaching you directly. From the clinic's own line, dial these AT&T codes:

- Cancel all-call forwarding: *73

Your website chat shows a contact form until you remove the healdesk snippet from your website.

We'll email you when your export of transcripts and the booking log is ready. Download it by Sunday 6 December.

We destroy our copies of your data within 30 days of your export being delivered, and by Thursday 4 February 2027 at the latest. Billing records are kept, as tax law requires.

—
