<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your Stripe account was connected to healdesk at 10:20 am EDT on Tuesday 6 October, from your healdesk account.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">AYA can now send deposit links in chat, paid straight into your own Stripe account. On the phone she can&#39;t send a link, so deposits there are left to your team.</p>
