<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#1f2328;">
<span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">$80 for the month to Tuesday 6 October.</span>
<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">In the month from Sunday 6 September to Tuesday 6 October, AYA handled more than your plan includes. Past your allowance:</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;"><li>30 voice minutes, billed as 1 block of 100 voice minutes at $80</li></ul>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Overage is billed for each started block of 100, so that comes to $80, charged to the card on file. The rates are provisional until we&#39;ve measured what each minute and conversation costs us.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 24px;"><a class="hd-action" href="https://invoice.stripe.com/i/acct_testplatform/test_invoice" style="display:inline-block;background:#1f2328;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">View the invoice</a></p>
