<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Until every channel in it is in service, you&#39;re billed for Web Chatbot. Each other channel&#39;s price joins from the day it first answers. A channel that&#39;s ready but waiting on a step of yours joins 30 days after it became ready or after your plan started, whichever is later, and we email you a week before.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The difference in setup fee, $500, was charged with the change, and that&#39;s all the invoice covers: the price you&#39;re billed hasn&#39;t changed.</p>
